{"id":"7ce998ba18c1c45a","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-veblen-normal-form.md","title":"非强临界主序数的 Veblen 分解","display":"thm-veblen-normal-form — 非强临界主序数的 Veblen 分解","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-veblen-normal-form","aliases":["18-thm-veblen-normal-form"],"display":"thm-veblen-normal-form — 非强临界主序数的 Veblen 分解","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]","[[18-thm-veblen-comparison]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 3.3.4; Theorem 3.4.11; Lemma 3.4.17","source_pages":"29, 38–39, 41","source_pdf_pages":"39, 48–49, 51","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-veblen-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-veblen-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-veblen-normal-form — 非强临界主序数的 Veblen 分解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76bd927de48a9849\" href=\"?note=76bd927de48a9849\" title=\"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal\">18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"770aefc56bf0351b\" href=\"?note=770aefc56bf0351b\" title=\"18-thm-veblen-comparison\">18-thm-veblen-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 3.3.4; Theorem 3.4.11; Lemma 3.4.17"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"29, 38–39, 41"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39, 48–49, 51"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76bd927de48a9849\" href=\"?note=76bd927de48a9849\" title=\"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal\">18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H\">\\(\\mathrm H\\)</span> 由下式作为局部主序数类定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid0&lt;\\alpha\\land\n\\forall\\xi,\\eta&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\xi+\\eta&lt;\\alpha)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm H\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid0&lt;\\alpha\\land\n\\forall\\xi,\\eta&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\xi+\\eta&lt;\\alpha)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm H\\setminus\\mathrm{SC}\\;\\exists!(\\xi,\\eta)\\in\\alpha\\times\\alpha\\;\n\\alpha=\\varphi_\\xi(\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm H\\setminus\\mathrm{SC}\\;\\exists!(\\xi,\\eta)\\in\\alpha\\times\\alpha\\;\n\\alpha=\\varphi_\\xi(\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核 Definition 3.3.4、Theorem 3.4.11 和 Lemma 3.4.17 的证明。先取 ξ 为使 α&lt;φξ(α) 的最小指标得到唯一 η&lt;α；若 ξ=α 则 α=φα(0) 为强临界，故排除 SC 后 ξ&lt;α。旧目录未有“两个参数均严格较小”的分解定理，它是 §3.4.3 记号系统递归终止性的直接依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal-addition","status":"resolved","id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"76bd927de48a9849","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-veblen-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"770aefc56bf0351b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-veblen-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\varphi$ 与 $\\mathrm{SC}$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]。$\\mathrm H$ 由下式作为局部主序数类定义。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"76bd927de48a9849","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\varphi$ 与 $\\mathrm{SC}$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]。$\\math